    "That position connects ThaWizZarD to the long history of his instrument in Dominica. Bouyon was born from a keyboardist gesture, that of Cornel “Fingers” Phillip and his brothers in <a href=\"/en/wck.html\">WCK</a>, who turned the jing ping accordion into electronic keyboards. Almost forty years later, keyboardist hands still set the temperature of the records, from the Trilla-G cypher to the singles of his platform. That lineage is not claimed by ThaWizZarD in our sources, and this profile does not lend it to him as a statement: it can be read in the facts, instrument by instrument, credit by credit.",
